ui.ascendant:alchemy.help=§eBrewing\n§r1. Place up to 6 bottles in the lower pairs.\n2. Place the reagent in the upper middle slot.\n3. Put blaze powder in the fuel slot.\nBrewing starts automatically with energy and resources.\nOne reagent is consumed per batch.\n\n§eAplifying\n§rLeft: increases level (1000 mB).\nRight: extends duration (750 mB).\nPlace a potion and press the button below its slot.\nBoth use liquid Aetherium.\nUnsupported potions and maximum upgrades cannot be improved.\n\n§eTanks\n§rBlaze: 64000 mB; 1000 mB per powder.\nAetherium: 128000 mB; fluid input.
